        <mxCell id="transition-note" value="CURRENT STATUS RULE&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Server Action accepts any value from the order_status enum and records the change. A transition matrix such as APPROVED_FOR_PRODUCTION -&amp;gt; IN_PRODUCTION is not enforced yet and must be designed before production workflow rules become stricter." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fefce8;strokeColor=#ca8a04;fontColor=#111827;spacing=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
